---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import { codeTheme } from '../content/examples';
const bindingCode = `// fire is a manual-clock attachment.
timeline.addLabel('ignite', 0.5);
const binding = bindFire(fire, timeline, {
  time: 4,
  intensity: 0.4,
  duration: 4,
  position: 'ignite',
});`;
---
<section class="integration-features" aria-label="GSAP integration walkthrough">
<article class="feature-row" aria-labelledby="cue-title"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <h3 id="cue-title">Give it a cue.</h3>
              <p>Add an entrance. Place a label. Bring in Fire.</p>
            <dl class="walkthrough-notes">
              <div>
                <dt>Make an entrance</dt>
                <dd>Start with the motion already in your timeline.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>Name the moment</dt>
                <dd>The <code>ignite</code> label marks where Fire starts, at 0.5 seconds.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>Give it time</dt>
                <dd>The binding runs for four seconds, alongside the rest of your sequence.</dd>
              </div>
            </dl></div><div class="feature-visual"><figure class="sequence" aria-label="Example timeline: entrance from 0 to 0.5 seconds, followed by a four-second Fire binding ending at 4.5 seconds.">
              <div class="ruler" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>Time</span>
                <div><span>0s</span><span>0.5s</span><span>2.5s</span><span>4.5s</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="sequence-lane" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>Entrance</span>
                <div class="lane-track"><span class="entrance-bar"></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="sequence-lane" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>Fire</span>
                <div class="lane-track">
                  <span class="fire-bar"><span>ignite</span><span>4 seconds →</span></span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </figure></div></article>
<article class="feature-row" aria-labelledby="bind-title"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <h3 id="bind-title">Bind the effect.</h3>
              <p>Keep the timeline you own. Give Fire a destination and a place in the sequence.</p>
            <div class="binding-explanation">
              <div class="binding-flow" aria-label="bindFire connects a Fire attachment to your GSAP timeline">
                <span>Fire attachment</span><span class="binding-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                <code>bindFire()</code><span class="binding-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><span>Your timeline</span>
              </div>
              <p>
                Time and intensity interpolate linearly from their values when the binding starts.
              </p>
              <a class="secondary" href="#complete-gsap">See the complete setup <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
            </div></div><div class="feature-visual"><div class="binding-code">
              <div class="code-label"><span>timeline.ts</span><span>@domfx/gsap</span></div>
              <div tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Illustrative GSAP binding excerpt"><Code code={bindingCode} lang="ts" theme={codeTheme} /></div>
            </div></div></article>
<article class="feature-row" aria-labelledby="controls-title"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <h3 id="controls-title">Your timeline.<br>Your controls.</h3>
              <p>Use the GSAP methods you already know.</p>
            <dl class="walkthrough-notes methods">
              <div>
                <dt><code>play() / pause()</code></dt>
                <dd>Run or hold the sequence.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt><code>seek() / reverse()</code></dt>
                <dd>Visit a moment or play backward.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt><code>timeScale()</code></dt>
                <dd>Change the playback speed.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt><code>repeat / yoyo</code></dt>
                <dd>Configure these on your timeline.</dd>
              </div>
            </dl></div><div class="feature-visual"><section class="timeline-player" aria-label="Interactive GSAP timeline player">
  <div class="player-heading"><strong>Play it your way.</strong><span>GSAP timeline</span></div>
  <svg class="player-stage" viewBox="0 0 480 240" role="img" aria-label="Three shapes lift, turn and settle together as you control the timeline.">
    <path d="M32 190H448" stroke="#454754" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/>
    <g data-shape><path d="M70 145V95H120V120H95V145Z" fill="#C2C5DB"/></g>
    <g data-shape><path d="M220 145V95H270V120H245V145Z" fill="#F047FE"/></g>
    <g data-shape><path d="M370 145V95H420V120H395V145Z" fill="#E6DC6A"/></g>
  </svg>
  <fieldset class="player-controls" disabled>
    <legend class="sr-only">Timeline controls</legend>
    <div class="player-time"><label for="player-seek">Seek</label><span data-player-state role="status">Paused</span><output for="player-seek" aria-live="off">0.0 / 4.0s</output></div>
    <input class="player-seek" id="player-seek" type="range" min="0" max="4" step="0.01" value="0" aria-valuetext="0 of 4 seconds">
    <div class="player-phases" aria-hidden="true"><span>Lift</span><span>Turn</span><span>Settle</span></div>
    <div class="player-actions">
      <button type="button" data-action="play"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Play</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="pause"><span aria-hidden="true">Ⅱ</span> Pause</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="reverse"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Reverse</button>
    </div>
    <div class="player-options">
      <label>Speed <select name="speed"><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option><option value="1.5">1.5×</option><option value="2">2×</option></select></label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="repeat">Repeat</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="yoyo">Yoyo</label>
    </div>
  </fieldset>
  <p class="player-note">Enable JavaScript to try the timeline controls.</p>
</section>
</div></article>
</section>
